So, what was the restaurant like?

716
00:32:15,183 --> 00:32:18,228
Were the Yelp reviews right?
Did the calamari taste frozen?

717
00:32:18,311 --> 00:32:20,688
Oh, I had steak, so I couldn't say.

718
00:32:20,771 --> 00:32:22,023
[Gus] Hey.

719
00:32:24,692 --> 00:32:26,945
-Room's different.
-Mickey rearranged.

720
00:32:27,028 --> 00:32:28,821
Ah.

721
00:32:28,904 --> 00:32:31,782
Oh, my God.
I have that, like, same rug.

722
00:32:31,866 --> 00:32:33,868
Except mine's in blue, not orange.

723
00:32:33,952 --> 00:32:35,161
I wanted orange, but...

724
00:32:35,245 --> 00:32:36,454
It's Mickey's rug.

725
00:32:36,537 --> 00:32:37,872
Ah.

726
00:32:39,624 --> 00:32:41,501
Got the same rug. Cool.

727
00:32:41,584 --> 00:32:44,337
Okay, well, thank you
for the good time tonight.

728
00:32:44,420 --> 00:32:46,464
-Yes. It was fun.
-That was really fun.

729
00:32:46,547 --> 00:32:48,883
-Yeah, take care.
-All right. You, too.

730
00:32:48,966 --> 00:32:51,052
Hey, dude, those text messages
were so funny.

731
00:32:51,136 --> 00:32:53,388
-Oh, you like that?
-I was laughing all night.

732
00:32:53,471 --> 00:32:55,723
Oh. Good, good, good.
You know...

733
00:32:55,806 --> 00:32:57,100
[smacks lips] I tried.

734
00:33:00,478 --> 00:33:02,438
-Are you pissed at me?
-Okay...

735
00:33:03,731 --> 00:33:05,108
Mickey, you know I like you.

736
00:33:05,775 --> 00:33:07,110
I don't have a lot of dignity...

737
00:33:07,943 --> 00:33:10,363
but I have enough dignity to say, like,

738
00:33:10,446 --> 00:33:13,158
hey, I don't like being
pawned off on another girl.

739
00:33:13,241 --> 00:33:17,537
I'm not just, like,
some nice guy

740
00:33:17,620 --> 00:33:20,248
who's always gonna be around
for you to, like, fuck with.

741
00:33:20,331 --> 00:33:22,667
What do you want me to say? [stutters]

742
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:24,210
I don't know.

743
00:33:25,295 --> 00:33:28,131
I'm not dumb.
I know what this is.

744
00:33:28,214 --> 00:33:29,715
I get it.

745
00:33:29,799 --> 00:33:31,926
You're not interested.
It's cool.

746
00:33:32,010 --> 00:33:33,469
We can just say it's cool.

747
00:33:34,804 --> 00:33:36,681
Pleasure to meet ya.

748
00:33:36,764 --> 00:33:37,765
Okay.

749
00:33:50,611 --> 00:33:52,155
[car beeping]

750
00:34:00,038 --> 00:34:02,790
-Stop!
-[brakes screech]

751
00:34:02,873 --> 00:34:05,793
Hey! Hello, that was,
like, super dangerous!

752
00:34:14,927 --> 00:34:16,387
Fun first date, huh?

753
00:34:21,809 --> 00:34:23,769
What the fuck was that?

754
00:34:24,979 --> 00:34:26,981
[acoustic music playing]

